## Component Design Patterns

### MetricCard
```tsx
interface MetricCardProps {
    label: string;           // "Win Rate"
    value: string;           // "56.2%"
    trend: 'up' | 'down' | 'flat';
    trendValue: string;      // "+2.1%"
    status: 'good' | 'warning' | 'danger';
}
```

### GraduationMeter
```tsx
interface GraduationMeterProps {
    criteria: {
        name: string;
        value: number;
        threshold: number;
        met: boolean;
    }[];
    consecutiveDays: number;
    requiredDays: number;
}
// Progress bars with threshold marker lines
// Green fill when met, amber when close (>80%), red when far
```

### TrainingChart
```tsx
interface TrainingChartProps {
    data: { step: number; value: number }[];
    metric: 'reward' | 'loss' | 'entropy' | 'win_rate';
    showMovingAverage: boolean;
    movingAverageWindow: number;
}
// Recharts LineChart with area fill
// Moving average overlay
// Tooltip with episode details
```

## Animation & Transitions

### Durations
- **Instant:** 50ms (toggles)
- **Quick:** 150ms (hover states)
- **Normal:** 250ms (modals, cards)
- **Slow:** 400ms (page transitions)

### Key Animations
- **New agent action:** Slide-in from left (300ms)
- **Odds change:** Flash green/red background (200ms)
- **Graduation criterion met:** Pulse green glow (600ms)
- **Training step:** Counter increment animation

## Responsive Design
- **Desktop first** (1280px+): Full 3-column layout
- **Tablet** (768-1279px): 2-column, stacked panels
- **Mobile** (< 768px): Single column, tab navigation

## Accessibility
- WCAG 2.1 AA minimum
- High contrast ratios (4.5:1 for text)
- Keyboard navigation for all controls
- Screen reader labels for charts
- Reduced motion support

## Integration with Other Personas

